This project is a TypeScript/Node.js port of:
  icloud_photos_downloader
  https://github.com/icloud-photos-downloader/icloud_photos_downloader

Originally released under the MIT License by The iCloud Photo Downloader Authors.
Ported logic is kept in sync with upstream Python source; when Apple changes
iCloud APIs, we follow upstream fixes rather than reverse-engineering ourselves.
